OL,3,GNEWSANew buyer set to purchase
OL,4,AGloucestershire Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA preferred bidder has been selected to
OL,7,Fbuy an airport, months after the
OL,8,Fprevious sale fell through.
OL,10,FGloucester City Council and Cheltenham
OL,11,FBorough Council - joint shareholders of
OL,12,FGloucestershire Airport - confirmed on
OL,13,FThursday a company had been successful
OL,14,Fin bidding for the 350-acre site at
OL,15,FStaverton.
OL,17,FThe councils said no further details
OL,18,Fabout the successful bidder can be
OL,19,Freleased as the process will now move
OL,20,Finto a period of due diligence.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
