OL,3,GNEWSANew buyer set to purchase
OL,4,AGloucestershire Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn March, a previous attempt to sell
OL,7,Fthe airport, running at an annual loss
OL,8,Fof about #2.1m, fell through after
OL,9,Feight months of negotiations. Superdry
OL,10,Ffounder Julian Dunkerton and business
OL,11,Fpartner Chris Makin confirmed they were
OL,12,Funsuccessful in their bid.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
